    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq1_q | default: 'Do I need an electrician?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq1_a | default: "No. Every lamp in this kit is plug-in. There's no ceiling access, no hardwiring, no switches to install. Unboxing is the installation — plug it in and the room works." }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq2_q | default: 'Will this light a full room?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq2_a | default: 'Yes. A full kit is 3+ lamps with one floor lamp as the anchor — the floor lamp is what makes the room actually feel lit, not just accented. Two secondary lamps plus the anchor cover every zone you use after dark. Larger rooms: add a fourth or fifth lamp.' }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq3_q | default: 'What does "2700K" mean?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq3_a | default: "Color temperature. 2700K is warm white — the color of firelight and the standard in almost every hotel and fine dining room. It's been shown to be gentler on evening circadian rhythm than the 4000K+ you'll find in most big-box LEDs." }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq4_q | default: 'How does the $150 Warm Credit work?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq4_a | default: 'It applies automatically to your account at checkout. When you come back to configure your next room — any Tier 2 kit (3+ lamps with a floor-lamp anchor) — the credit comes off the total. Not a discount; the second room is how the system works.' }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq5_q | default: 'Can I swap lamps later?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq5_a | default: 'Yes, right now and after purchase. On this page, tap any slot to see alternatives. Once shipped, our 30-day return policy covers swaps — no questions, pre-paid return label.' }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq6_q | default: 'What if I just want one lamp?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq6_a | default: "The kit framework is optional. You can buy any lamp individually. But you'll lose the Tier 1 / Tier 2 freebies and the Warm Credit — which together are worth $338 on a 3+ lamp kit with the floor-lamp anchor." }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq7_q | default: 'How fast does it ship?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq7_a | default: 'Orders placed before 2 PM PT ship the same day; everything else goes out next business day. Standard shipping is free in the continental US and arrives in 3–5 business days. Expedited and 2-day options at checkout.' }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq8_q | default: 'What if I don&#39;t love it?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq8_a | default: '30-day returns, no questions asked. Plug the kit in, live with it for a week or four. If the room doesn&#39;t feel different, send it back with the pre-paid label we include in the box. Full refund, no restocking fees — even the freebies stay yours.' }}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{{ section.settings.faq9_q | default: 'Do you ship outside the US?' }} <span class="ic">+</span></summary>
      <p>{{ section.settings.faq9_a | default: 'Not yet. The kit is US-only right now — the plug standard, voltage, and free shipping all assume a US address. Email hello@warmbydesign.com if you want a heads-up when we open to your country.' }}</p>
    </details>
    <div class="faq-cta">
      <button class="scroll-to-kit" data-scroll-target=".main-split" type="button">Ready? Back to your kit ↑</button>
