    'Hand-Poured Beeswax Tapers': 'Two 100% beeswax tapers. Burn at the warm end of the visible spectrum — like 2700K, but actual fire.',
    'Beeswax Tapers': 'Two 100% beeswax tapers. Burn at the warm end of the visible spectrum — like 2700K, but actual fire.',
    'Next Room Credit': '$150 toward your next kit. Auto-applies at checkout when you build another room — a kitchen, an office, a guest space.'
